a    b    c    
1     2     1     

Query plan:
temp(order by)
    subplan: idx-join (left outer join)
                 outer: temp(sort limit)
                            subplan: iscan
                                         class: n? node[?]
                                         index: i_n? term[?] (covers)
                                         cost:  ? card ?
                            cost:  ? card ?
                 inner: iscan
                            class: p? node[?]
                            index: i_p? term[?]
                            sargs: term[?]
                            cost:  ? card ?
                 sargs: term[?]
                 cost:  ? card ?
    sort:  ? asc, ? asc
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select n?.a, n?.b, n?.c from n? n? left outer join p? p? on n?.b= ?:?  and p?.a=n?.a where (n?.a> ?:? ) order by ?, ? for orderby_num()<= ?:? 
